### 10/12 `parser_parse_state`

> "…pretty-prints the **analysis stack**, **remaining input stack**, and **active production** for each parser step."

```cpp
void print_state(stack<char> analysis_s, stack<char> input_s, rule& rule_temp) {
	//分析栈自栈底向栈顶输出：出栈先得到栈顶符号，收集完再整体反转
	string analysis = "";
	while (!analysis_s.empty()) {
		analysis += analysis_s.top();
		analysis_s.pop();
	}
	reverse(analysis.begin(), analysis.end());
	//输入栈的栈顶就是当前读头，出栈顺序正好是剩余输入串的自然顺序
	string input = "";
	while (!input_s.empty()) {
		input += input_s.top();
		input_s.pop();
	}
	//推导步骤显示所用的产生式，匹配步骤右部为空、只显示被匹配掉的终结符
	string action = "";
	if (!rule_temp.right.empty()) {
		ostringstream text;
		text << rule_temp;
		action = text.str();
	}
	else if (rule_temp.left != ' ') {
		action = string("匹配") + rule_temp.left;
	}
	cout << left << setw(20) << analysis << setw(20) << input << setw(16) << action << endl;
	cout << right;
}
```

Clause map: *"analysis stack"* — both stacks are taken **by value**, which is precisely why the signature is what it is: draining the copies is free and the caller's stacks are untouched. Analysis is reversed to read bottom→top (`#)GE,`), input is not (its top *is* the read head, so pop order already gives `a,a)#`). *"active production"* — the three-way encoding from Q6; `reverse` comes from `<algorithm>`, `ostringstream` from `<sstream>`, both already included.

### 11/12 `parser_analysis_init` — bootstrap half of `syntacticAnalysis`

> "…**read the input string**, **initialize the input and analysis stacks**, **print the trace header**, and **prepare the parse-status flag**."

```cpp
void syntacticAnalysis(LL_1_table table) {
	cout << endl << "接下来进行语法分析" << endl << "请输入字符串：" << endl;
	string input;
	cin >> input;

	//输入栈：栈底放输入串结束符“#”，待分析串逆序进栈，栈顶即当前读头
	stack<char> input_s;
	input_s.push('#');
	for (int i = (int)input.length() - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
		input_s.push(input[i]);
	}
	//分析栈：栈底同样放“#”，再压入文法开始符号，即行表头的第一个非终结符
	stack<char> analysis_s;
	analysis_s.push('#');
	if (!table.row.empty()) {
		analysis_s.push(table.row[0]);
	}
	//分析状态标志：一旦出现无法匹配或查不到产生式的情况就置为false
	bool success = true;
	int step = 1;

	//输出分析过程的表头
	cout << endl << "语法分析过程如下：" << endl;
	cout << left << setw(8) << "步骤" << setw(20) << "分析栈" << setw(20) << "剩余输入串" << setw(16) << "所用产生式" << endl;
	cout << right;
```

Clause map: *"read the input string"* — `cin >> input` (kept exactly as shipped; `run_parser.sh` pipes one line). *"initialize the input and analysis stacks"* — `#` at both stack bottoms; the input pushed **in reverse** so `top()` is the leftmost unread character; the analysis stack seeded with `table.row[0]` = the start symbol (Q2), guarded for the empty-grammar case. *"print the trace header"* — the four `setw` columns that `print_state` fills. *"prepare the parse-status flag"* — `bool success = true;`, the single variable the final verdict reads.

### 12/12 `parser_analysis` — parse loop half

> "…run the LL(1) parse loop over the analysis/input stacks, **expand non-terminals through the table**, **match terminals**, and **report acceptance or rejection**."

```cpp
	while (true) {
		char top = analysis_s.top();
		char head = input_s.top();
		rule rule_temp;
		rule_temp.left = ' ';//该步骤没有用到产生式时这一列留空

		if (top == '#') {
			//分析栈退到栈底：输入串同时读完则分析成功，否则输入串还有多余的符号
			cout << left << setw(8) << step;
			print_state(analysis_s, input_s, rule_temp);
			if (head != '#') {
				success = false;
				cout << "    出错：分析栈已空，输入串中还剩下符号“" << head << "”" << endl;
			}
			break;
		}
		if (index_of(table.row, top) < 0) {
			//栈顶是终结符：与当前输入符号相同则匹配掉，否则分析失败
			if (top != head) {
				success = false;
				cout << left << setw(8) << step;
				print_state(analysis_s, input_s, rule_temp);
				cout << "    出错：栈顶终结符“" << top << "”与当前输入符号“" << head << "”不匹配" << endl;
				break;
			}
			rule_temp.left = top;//匹配步骤只记录被匹配掉的终结符，右部保持为空
			cout << left << setw(8) << step;
			print_state(analysis_s, input_s, rule_temp);
			analysis_s.pop();
			input_s.pop();
			step++;
			continue;
		}
		//栈顶是非终结符：查分析表决定用哪一条产生式展开
		int r = index_of(table.row, top);
		int c = index_of(table.col, head);
		rule cell;
		cell.left = ' ';
		if (c >= 0) {
			cell = table.rules[r * table.col.size() + c];
		}
		if (cell.right.empty()) {
			success = false;
			cout << left << setw(8) << step;
			print_state(analysis_s, input_s, rule_temp);
			cout << "    出错：分析表中“" << top << "”行“" << head << "”列是空白单元格" << endl;
			break;
		}
		rule_temp = cell;
		cout << left << setw(8) << step;
		print_state(analysis_s, input_s, rule_temp);
		//用产生式右部替换掉栈顶的非终结符，右部逆序进栈，“@”代表空串不进栈
		analysis_s.pop();
		string right_part = cell.right[0];
		if (right_part != "@") {
			for (int k = (int)right_part.length() - 1; k >= 0; k--) {
				analysis_s.push(right_part[k]);
			}
		}
		step++;
		if (step > 1000) {
			//文法有环或者不满足LL(1)条件时可能一直展开下去，加一道保险
			success = false;
			cout << "    出错：分析步骤过多，分析过程无法结束" << endl;
			break;
		}
	}

	cout << endl << "字符串" << input;
	if (!success) {
		cout << "不";
	}
	cout << "是该文法的句子" << endl;
}
```

Clause map:
* *"run the LL(1) parse loop over the analysis/input stacks"* — single `while (true)` on `(analysis_s.top(), input_s.top())`, one printed row per step, `step++` on every action.
* *"expand non-terminals through the table"* — `index_of(table.row, top) >= 0` ⇒ non-terminal ⇒ look up `[r][c]`, pop, push `cell.right[0]` **right-to-left** so the leftmost symbol ends on top; `"@"` pushes nothing (epsilon), which is how `M::=@` shrinks the stack.
* *"match terminals"* — the `top == head` branch pops both stacks and reports `匹配a`.
* *"report acceptance or rejection"* — three rejection paths (leftover input, terminal mismatch, blank cell — plus the loop cap), each printing the offending state row *and* a 出错 explanation before `break`; acceptance is `top=='#' && head=='#'` with `success` untouched. `if (!success) cout << "不";` is the one edit to the shipped tail.
* `index_of(table.col, head) < 0` (an input character that is not a grammar terminal) falls into the blank-cell path rather than indexing out of bounds.

